    (hhr : ∀ G bga rs acc, AccT U key domain hs hL P hdrLen (maskedFX U tag hL20 P (polyXof U tag hL20 P hlc 16 256 24448 4577 4390 rE QE XE prog pubs)) (Link.csShieldR13 U tag hL20
